      "id": "server_text",
      "x": 1212,
      "y": 294,
      "width": 516,
      "height": 162,
      "text": "HTTP SERVER  ·  server.mjs\nServes public UI · loopback only\nApp routes: login, workspace, decisions, jobs\nBridge routes: /api/bridge/* · bearer token\nPair code: one-use · 5 min · in memory\nValidates host, origin, account, media URLs",
      "originalText": "HTTP SERVER  ·  server.mjs\nServes public UI · loopback only\nApp routes: login, workspace, decisions, jobs\nBridge routes: /api/bridge/* · bearer token\nPair code: one-use · 5 min · in memory\nValidates host, origin, account, media URLs",
