      "x": 1932,
      "y": 388,
      "width": 346,
      "height": 238,
      "text": "PRIVATE PHOTOS RPCs\nLibrary + metadata\nlcxiM · EWgK9e\n\nAlbum find/create/members/add\nZ5xsfc · OXvT9d · snAcKc · E1Cajb\n\nTrash + item state reads\nzy0IHe · VrseUb\n\nPreview media: googleusercontent hosts",
