      "x": 82,
      "y": 1010,
      "width": 2200,
      "height": 54,
      "text": "PAIRING  ·  App issues a six-digit code; popup reads the active Photos account. Server returns a random token, stores only its hash in pairs, and the extension saves token + account + tab ID.",
      "originalText": "PAIRING  ·  App issues a six-digit code; popup reads the active Photos account. Server returns a random token, stores only its hash in pairs, and the extension saves token + account + tab ID.",
