      "x": 82,
      "y": 1080,
      "width": 2200,
      "height": 86,
      "text": "PERSISTED STATE  ·  Imported metadata + revisioned keep/remove decisions → verified album-job checkpoints → read-only Trash reconciliation.\nALBUM WRITES  ·  Extension checks membership before and after adding candidates; partial progress can be retried. Moving photos to Trash remains an explicit user action in Google Photos.",
      "originalText": "PERSISTED STATE  ·  Imported metadata + revisioned keep/remove decisions → verified album-job checkpoints → read-only Trash reconciliation.\nALBUM WRITES  ·  Extension checks membership before and after adding candidates; partial progress can be retried. Moving photos to Trash remains an explicit user action in Google Photos.",
